Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.06,0:00:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, castle's down!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.50,0:00:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,They were ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.50,0:00:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.20,0:00:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure kept me waiting, little fleas!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.56,0:00:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We're done for!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.14,0:00:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.20,0:01:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Jim
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.38,0:01:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Get moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.32,0:01:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Why does it always fall on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.28,0:01:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it all the hell
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.42,0:01:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Heavenly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.00,0:01:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.18,0:01:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Riju!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.14,0:01:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Ignore her, both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.18,0:01:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's her fault for being weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.38,0:01:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Focus on the mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.76,0:01:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He's such a sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.08,0:01:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I'm not done yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.02,0:02:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I might as well start with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.46,0:02:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,So long, Jermagirl!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.18,0:02:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Kum Kum!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.60,0:02:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Cap-lis-shom-beh! Cross!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.06,0:02:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make Kum Kum!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.30,0:02:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too bright!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.54,0:02:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought we weren't\Nsupposed to go outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.68,0:02:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you're not supposed to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.08,0:02:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I can do whatever I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.64,0:02:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You cheater!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.20,0:02:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Loopy, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.88,0:02:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Please come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.40,0:03:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a monster deep within your dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.82,0:03:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Taking aim for your\Nheart so it would seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.54,0:03:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,To stand tall and read, go to\Nhell and jump for paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.52,0:03:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time dangerous, dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.50,0:03:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We like it serious, serious, oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.20,0:03:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Looking deep in the dream\Nthere is the one in pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.74,0:03:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Turns out that's the one who\Nmeans the most to you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.12,0:03:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Adventure calls now, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.70,0:03:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The balls filled between\Nus, they will show.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.40,0:03:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Still what we don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.78,0:03:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, working hard together.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.10,0:03:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.10,0:03:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Got to dream to fight the rivalry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.80,0:03:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta see it through believing in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.64,0:03:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,There's even charm in failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.22,0:03:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.48,0:03:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,All the love and the tears\Nin the world we're in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.10,0:04:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,United gently bringing up\Nour thought again, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.96,0:04:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We're the foolish ones we love.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.56,0:04:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll carry on till we see the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.94,0:04:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The sun will rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.34,0:04:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The greatest fight at its core.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.10,0:04:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Is against myself forevermore.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.96,0:04:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's do it now, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.58,0:04:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The bonds go between us, they will show.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.20,0:04:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So what we don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.46,0:04:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what we call adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.12,0:04:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.92,0:04:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Got to dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.44,0:04:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like the rivalry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.62,0:04:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta see it through.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.04,0:04:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But living in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.42,0:04:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,There's even charm in failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.06,0:04:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.06,0:04:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.64,0:04:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we're the superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.40,0:04:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.12,0:04:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we're the superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.20,0:04:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers, Superpowers, Superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.20,0:05:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we're the Superpowers, Superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.18,0:05:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we're the Superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.76,0:05:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,My, my, my, my!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.80,0:05:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you running away?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.42,0:05:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it because you're\Ntoo scared to fight me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.32,0:05:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you remember what\Nyou told me, Straw Hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.62,0:05:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The first time we spoke when\Nyou were on Fishman Island,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.74,0:05:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe you said you\Nwere going to kick my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.68,0:05:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, Monkey D.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.52,0:05:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, now that I know\Nwho you are, come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.54,0:05:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's chat in the new world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.92,0:05:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I like this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.82,0:05:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too risky to trust you with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.58,0:05:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I get there, I'm gonna kick your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.92,0:05:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And then I'll make Fishman\NIsland my territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.76,0:06:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And do you remember what you said to me\Nwhen you were captured in my library?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.38,0:06:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Something about making\Nme sorry, if I recall.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.26,0:06:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You haven't become King of the\NPirates, and that's on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.66,0:06:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing else to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.38,0:06:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Get over here and fight me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.24,0:06:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not backing down Even\Nif you are an emperor!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.30,0:06:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm taking Sanji back no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.64,0:06:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna turn this all\Naround and make you sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.28,0:06:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And now you want to run?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.70,0:06:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess you're all talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.60,0:06:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm all talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.34,0:06:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,She's just trying to provoke you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.56,0:06:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Just one punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.04,0:06:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.46,0:06:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I said that stuff and I meant it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.16,0:06:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'll prove it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.92,0:06:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoop!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.82,0:07:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You will never be king\Nof the pirates, Big Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.26,0:07:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But I will be!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.30,0:07:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, excellent work!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.48,0:07:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It sure is nice having\Nhuman shields! It's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.06,0:07:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,No betrayal shall go unpunished!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.88,0:08:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll burn you to death with my own hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.36,0:08:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This one is scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.92,0:08:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Wondered when an oven was shown?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.26,0:08:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure you suffer! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.94,0:08:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You two play nice, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.40,0:08:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not burning anybody, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.60,0:08:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're looking to get pounded in the\Nface, you're in the right place, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.50,0:08:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That's some faceless confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.56,0:08:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We're almost there, kid, just keep it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.02,0:08:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think I'm trying to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.48,0:08:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Just so many of them are there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.30,0:08:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.38,0:08:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I won't die after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.40,0:08:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Lickety, let's end this\Nsticky situation quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.22,0:08:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Candy wall!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.64,0:08:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.18,0:09:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is that\Nand why is it in my way?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.66,0:09:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Must be Pierre Sparrow's way!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.90,0:09:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm back to being doomed, aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.98,0:09:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,My help just fades away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.72,0:09:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, nuts!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.66,0:09:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gonna swallow us up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.04,0:09:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn back! No! Keep going!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.12,0:09:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.36,0:09:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Black Bug!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.92,0:09:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.78,0:09:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You're clear. What? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.64,0:09:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,A candy wall?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.74,0:10:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You saved me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.68,0:10:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I ever doubted you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.94,0:10:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,These German guys were\Nreally something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.58,0:10:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,They wrecked that candy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.90,0:10:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo le no!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.30,0:10:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,So scum-do!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.28,0:10:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so close!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.10,0:10:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I've made it this far,\NI really don't want to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.44,0:10:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Freedom within my sight!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.24,0:10:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's... the candy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.54,0:10:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But I swear!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.02,0:10:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It tastes so sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.56,0:10:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The Tomatee box is right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.34,0:10:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The secrets could be mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.84,0:10:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish it would have fallen\Nsomeplace more convenient.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.76,0:10:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't miss this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.46,0:10:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta jump.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.70,0:10:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you going to do\Nwith that treasure, Dufeld?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.18,0:10:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.22,0:10:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Stussy, you spying on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.30,0:11:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow, ow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.36,0:11:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That's smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.60,0:11:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But it'll all be worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.36,0:11:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The treasure of the deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.60,0:11:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever it is, it's got\Nto be something good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.26,0:11:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Flying Finger Pistol.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.00,0:11:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The world government will\Nbe claiming the Tomatei Box.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.08,0:11:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.82,0:11:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.98,0:11:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll still let you take the\Nblame for its disappearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.96,0:11:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I trust that's the story you'll be\Nwriting in your papers, Morgans. Busted!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.14,0:11:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as I can spy what's inside first.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.50,0:11:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, but don't touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.94,0:11:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure a professional spin doctor such
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.84,0:11:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,as yourself knows how\Nthe arrangement works.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.08,0:11:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a newsman!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.20,0:11:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That's slander!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.44,0:11:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.35,0:12:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me? Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.62,0:12:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to beat Kaido first.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.08,0:12:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You're next.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.26,0:12:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.18,0:12:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You said just one punch and you got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.52,0:12:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaido, you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.64,0:12:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,My, my, my, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.04,0:12:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,If that little punch\Nis the best you've got,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.74,0:12:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,he'll make quick work of you, I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.50,0:12:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But what makes you think\Nyou'll make it that far, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.04,0:12:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You little bastards are\Ngetting way ahead of yourselves
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.22,0:12:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,and you think I'm gonna let\Nyou escape my territory!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.08,0:13:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.92,0:13:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that my dream is\Ndead now, thanks to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.78,0:13:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Long ago, our empire reigned\Nfor a mere sixty-six days,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.96,0:13:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,but the ghosts who cannot return\Nto their homeland want us still!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.62,0:13:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I face them in defeat?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.86,0:13:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,To think that I trusted\Nyou with their memories,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.94,0:13:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,their cries for\Nrevenge—that have echoed for
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.32,0:13:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,three centuries—I can\Nhardly live with myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.36,0:13:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,with myself
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.22,0:13:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.52,0:13:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'll help you rest in peace, Judge.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.52,0:14:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be making\Nthe whole world peaceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.44,0:14:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to all the scientific\Nresearch I'll be taking from you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.38,0:14:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Run, Bethel!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.80,0:14:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.22,0:14:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Did she kill him?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.88,0:14:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.02,0:14:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You've abandoned me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.66,0:14:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You're supposed to be\Nmy escort, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.56,0:14:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did it have to be Katakuri?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.30,0:14:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did it have to be anybody?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.64,0:15:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you just let me go?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.36,0:15:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What a pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.27,0:15:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And you were so close, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.64,0:15:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I haven't abandoned my duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.24,0:15:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You better get moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.60,0:15:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to ask me twice!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.16,0:15:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think you'll get\Nthe upper hand that easily?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.00,0:15:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Or is it that you don't value your life?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.52,0:15:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're trying to\Nintimidate me, don't bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.54,0:15:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately for you,\NI don't experience fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.48,0:15:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep firing!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.18,0:15:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let them escape! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.22,0:15:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You can make it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.54,0:15:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We're counting on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.34,0:15:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You got this, Caesar!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.40,0:15:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You scumbag! Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.58,0:15:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that last part?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.44,0:16:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get in my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.28,0:16:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.19,0:16:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Move it, you moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.34,0:16:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.70,0:16:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You're me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.06,0:16:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, that doesn't make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.02,0:16:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me, you fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.82,0:16:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a good look.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.64,0:16:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Barrel!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.16,0:16:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't this nice?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.74,0:16:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, I had so much resentment\Npiling up, I hardly knew what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.78,0:16:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I get to take it all out on you\Nand your insufferable associates.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.70,0:16:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Just got ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.54,0:16:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Caesar.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.96,0:16:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Our whole team has lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.70,0:17:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.52,0:17:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This might be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.40,0:17:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.42,0:17:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,German, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.30,0:17:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,our escape plan has failed they won't rest
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.38,0:17:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,to her all dead are you\Ngiving up not at all
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.28,0:17:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,but the road ahead is a harsh one
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.22,0:17:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,anything beats waiting\Nfor death thankfully i've
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.48,0:17:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,still got a bit of fight\Nleft in me i'm going to Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.58,0:17:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.49,0:17:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And we'll help get your back, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.70,0:17:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If this is the only way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.18,0:18:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We were so close, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.26,0:18:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, the party's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.54,0:18:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But the executions are next.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.30,0:18:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.50,0:19:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,A while ago, deep beneath the sea...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.36,0:19:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy and the Straw Hats had just\Nsaved the Ryugu Kingdom from the new
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.00,0:19:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Fishman Pirates and received the\NTomate Box from King Neptune as thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.56,0:19:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.47,0:19:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.40,0:19:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure if Luffy\Nand the others found the
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.76,0:19:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomate Box among the stolen\Ntreasures we gave to them,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.26,0:19:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,but, uh, it might be wise to ask them\Nto give that particular present back!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.62,0:19:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.08,0:19:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I could never ask them to return a\Ngift that we gave them for saving us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.42,0:19:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The problem is it's not exactly treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.04,0:19:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's more like a bomb, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.82,0:20:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.73,0:20:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll explode if they open it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.98,0:20:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I must ask them to return it immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.48,0:20:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You gave the treasure away?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.68,0:20:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And the big mom no less?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.10,0:20:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe the explosives\Nare no longer functional.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.44,0:20:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Very good, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.86,0:20:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Misty, I do admire your positivity.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.86,0:20:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, back to the present.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.36,0:20:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the Red Bean Bomb meeting room.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.64,0:20:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got a massive crack running\Nfrom the Eastern Bomb second floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.34,0:20:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Not just a crack, it's\Nsplit straight in half.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.86,0:20:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Red Bean Bomb third floor here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.96,0:20:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.34,0:20:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't think this is\Nan earthquake, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.26,0:20:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna topple over!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.24,0:20:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.15,0:20:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear I heard an explosion before this!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.22,0:20:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's an enemy attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.52,0:20:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't matter!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.43,0:20:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get going!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.35,0:20:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever did this will help!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.38,0:21:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Who wasn't the enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.04,0:21:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe, but I don't know how.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.92,0:21:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Who could invade an emperor's home base?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.56,0:21:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,They must have snuck in with a bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.76,0:21:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Ridiculous, and how the hell\Ndid they get away with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.44,0:21:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't follow us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.10,0:21:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to die, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.94,0:21:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Does this have something to do\Nwith the wedding on the rooftop?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.90,0:22:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a total nightmare,\Nbut it's also big news.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.44,0:22:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Was there a bomb in\Nthat box, probably yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.30,0:22:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The timing was dead on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.22,0:22:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what else could\Nhave caused it, but why?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.02,0:22:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely they couldn't have planned this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.60,0:22:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going down.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.84,0:22:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.98,0:22:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I lost track of the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.96,0:22:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Did one of your allies do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.02,0:22:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Beats me, all I know is\Nthat if this didn't happen,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.88,0:22:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,then all of us would be dead for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.90,0:22:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.90,0:22:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to my Shit?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.60,0:23:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Something or other saved us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.88,0:23:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't say we're saved just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.04,0:23:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Far from it, in fact!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.02,0:23:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in big trouble, Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.50,0:23:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't know where,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.00,0:23:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,but an explosion went off and\Nnow the whole Shit is collapsing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.76,0:23:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going down!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.84,0:23:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's going on out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.60,0:23:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's kind of weird how we can't\Nfeel anything inside, Beach, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.98,0:23:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Any idea what might have caused this?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.68,0:23:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.94,0:23:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.86,0:23:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The situation has devolved into chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.50,0:23:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Judging from what I can see,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.48,0:23:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,it seems that the Shit itself\Nis toppling on its side.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.38,0:23:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of joke is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.76,0:24:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.18,0:24:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.88,0:24:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.14,0:24:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a good thing, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.18,0:24:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Who did this?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.26,0:24:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,How is this even possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.70,0:24:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,My brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.68,0:24:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,My sisters.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.80,0:24:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Are they gonna be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.96,0:24:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess so!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.72,0:24:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.62,0:24:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.36,0:24:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.98,0:25:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This is rich.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.06,0:25:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know who to thank for this, but\Nthey knocked it out of the ballpark.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.34,0:25:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,i don't even gotta knock\Noff big mom anymore what's
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.04,0:25:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,the point look at them the\Nbig mom pirates are Toast!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.96,0:25:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,They're done for!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.76,0:25:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,As good as dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.74,0:25:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,The castle is bigger than the whole city!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.30,0:25:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter if you run or not!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.22,0:25:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,None of us are making it out alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.50,0:25:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Big brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.20,0:26:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's stay calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.72,0:26:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This is big news! Really big!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.88,0:26:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.24,0:26:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,At this rate, you'll take it to the grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.56,0:26:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.47,0:26:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.00,0:26:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Unreal.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.80,0:26:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If we really are witnessing the end of\Nthe Big Mom Pirates, Morgan's is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.92,0:26:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That's quite a scoop.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.60,0:26:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.00,0:26:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Come up here, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.56,0:26:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.78,0:26:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you'd better hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.34,0:26:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got boofy, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.84,0:26:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I figured you were both both.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.90,0:26:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.52,0:26:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You two are crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.82,0:26:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope that was worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.38,0:27:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,We're glad that you're back.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.14,0:27:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, Caesar, let's amskrain.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.16,0:27:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What, did you think I was going back?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.22,0:27:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So long, suckers!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.40,0:27:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I think they're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.62,0:27:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Mission complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.90,0:27:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's withdraw.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.81,0:27:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.96,0:27:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you all right, pal?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.84,0:27:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.76,0:27:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We're done for!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.74,0:28:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Formatamorphosis!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.98,0:28:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Giant!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.68,0:28:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,SCREAMING.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.22,0:28:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.62,0:28:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,was
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.02,0:28:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,a close one.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.64,0:29:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Some kind of cream.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.06,0:29:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.24,0:29:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's sponge cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.92,0:29:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.12,0:29:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole cake Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.56,0:29:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It turned into an actual cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.26,0:29:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice move.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.64,0:29:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,All this was the head\Nchef's work, I would guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.52,0:29:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Save the entire family in one fell swoop.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.88,0:29:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.68,0:29:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,A cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.30,0:29:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,My castle turned into a cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.36,0:30:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.26,0:30:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The sweets that Struzan makes with\Nhis ability may fill your stomach,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.32,0:30:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,but don't taste very good. You made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.32,0:30:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I was worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.80,0:30:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.24,0:30:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Little rats.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.70,0:30:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Those bastards ruined my wedding cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.80,0:30:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,My cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.02,0:30:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Easy does it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.50,0:30:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I get a hand here? Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.74,0:30:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything will be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.56,0:30:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I was gone for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.74,0:30:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, crush my cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.08,0:30:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard someone yelling from over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.68,0:30:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry and help them!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.54,0:30:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.82,0:30:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Look who's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.38,0:30:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Mondore, sir! What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.20,0:30:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did the whole cake\NShit collapse like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.98,0:30:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The entire city got wrecked!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.86,0:30:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And what's with all this heavy cream?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.46,0:30:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut your traps!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.08,0:30:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not over yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.98,0:31:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Our enemies who plotted to\Nassassinate mama have gotten away.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.32,0:31:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We lost their trail, but they\Ncouldn't have gone very far
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.60,0:31:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry and call the tarts\Non all total land islands.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.74,0:31:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We're looking for the Straw Hat pirates\Nand the fire tank pirates as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.28,0:31:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let a single one of them escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.62,0:31:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.42,0:31:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Think this is far enough—get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.76,0:31:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,out
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.94,0:31:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for everything, Veggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.72,0:31:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We might be dead if it wasn't for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.72,0:31:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get sappy on me like\NI'd ever do a good deed.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.74,0:31:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.94,0:31:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're gonna thank\Nsomeone, then thank me!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.36,0:31:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I care with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.92,0:31:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Can it, you loser!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.52,0:31:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, I haven't forgotten what\Nyou did to those kids on Punk Hazard.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.78,0:31:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We do not need your help anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.84,0:32:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So go drop dead. Huh? Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.10,0:32:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Foolish girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.28,0:32:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You should show respect\Nwhen you speak to a genius!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.98,0:32:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want me to turn this entire\Nisland into a wasteland of poison gas?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.08,0:32:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.86,0:32:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.96,0:32:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.87,0:32:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Take your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.66,0:32:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.98,0:32:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I never thought this moment would arrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.74,0:32:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You earned your freedom, you scumbag.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.32,0:32:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You should have crushed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.06,0:32:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.97,0:32:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, please, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.84,0:32:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Should have crushed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.48,0:32:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,My heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.44,0:32:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm finally, finally whole again!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.94,0:32:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So long, suckers!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.28,0:32:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll see you in hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.86,0:33:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Morons!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.77,0:33:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Simpletons! Nedwins! Good riddance!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.62,0:33:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Why'd the castle fall?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.12,0:33:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems kind of sudden, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.10,0:33:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So, do you Karoo know who caused this?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.30,0:33:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Not the slightest clue!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.00,0:33:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Pay attention to me, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.02,0:33:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Bad news, Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.84,0:33:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe it or not, but\Nthe enemy is still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.74,0:33:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,They're a little shaken\Nup, Lili, but that's all!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.86,0:33:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole Shit turned into a cake, Lili.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.98,0:33:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Aha.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.89,0:33:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That would be Strewson's\Nanti-work, I assume.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.18,0:33:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That man was a mystery to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.38,0:33:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows what he had cooking.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.10,0:33:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That is to say, he's\Nmore than just a chef.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.78,0:33:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He's probably a real tough cookie, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.66,0:33:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought the big mom pirates were\Nkaput after seeing the Shit collapse.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.16,0:33:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,They're lucky to have that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.48,0:33:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.96,0:33:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,They still got screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.98,0:33:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But that makes me feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.90,0:33:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Would somebody please validate me?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.64,0:34:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So now we just gotta run away?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.98,0:34:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Kid, we've been trying to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.08,0:34:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just that people\Nkeep getting in our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.12,0:34:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,They're gone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.24,0:34:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But let's hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.86,0:34:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Do as you like, but we're\Nparting ways. Adios.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.40,0:34:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.88,0:34:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We failed to assassinate Big Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.08,0:34:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We have no reason to\Ncontinue with this alliance.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.22,0:34:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy gets it, but just as a tip:\NI'd start hauling ass if I were you,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.70,0:34:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,even after you set sail—it'll take a whole\Nday to get out of Big Mom's territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.68,0:34:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,True enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.88,0:34:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck, you bunch\Nof wackos, castle tank!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.54,0:34:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,tank
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.12,0:34:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hats went that way?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.44,0:34:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, how petty can that bastard get?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.18,0:34:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Shove it, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.34,0:34:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta survive. No fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.94,0:34:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to give them a\Nproper farewell le long.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.76,0:34:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami's my friend and we\Ntook off without a word.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.82,0:34:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Complain later.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.74,0:35:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Being clear, things might get rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.24,0:35:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, guess we'll be on our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.30,0:35:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,After retrieving the shark submerged,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.36,0:35:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll take it straight to the\Nsun and meet up with you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.14,0:35:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.44,0:35:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta make it all the way to\Nthe coast, so we better hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.48,0:35:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Daifugo, form two attack units.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.20,0:35:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.74,0:35:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Soldiers, split up.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.20,0:35:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,We're chasing down the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.80,0:35:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Half of you go after Straw Hat,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.86,0:35:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,and the other half will bring\Nback the head of that traitor,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.10,0:35:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Buggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.50,0:35:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama, listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.38,0:35:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,They won't escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.16,0:35:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, they'll pay for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.62,0:35:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,My cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.84,0:35:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It had the best ingredients,\Ncarefully selected.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.38,0:35:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It was going to be the queen of all cakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.54,0:36:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This was supposed to be the perfect day.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.32,0:36:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me my wedding cake right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.44,0:36:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.74,0:36:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is my cake?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.32,0:36:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you hiding my\Nwedding cake from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.14,0:36:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, not now, Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.08,0:36:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring me my wedding cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.82,0:36:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it to me now!
